{"id":"55ffcef2e3fdc1d4","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-natural-addition.md","title":"自然数加法","display":"df-natural-addition — 自然数加法","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-natural-addition","aliases":["18-df-natural-addition","18-df-008"],"display":"df-natural-addition — 自然数加法","depends_on":["[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"2.1.5","source_printed_pages":"12","source_pdf_pages":"23","source_correspondence":"exercise-solution","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-natural-addition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-natural-addition</span><span>18-df-008</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-natural-addition — 自然数加法"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.1.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"23"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"exercise-solution"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；函数项及求值见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f04544345afa1f92\" href=\"?note=f04544345afa1f92\" title=\"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms\">18-df-primitive-recursive-terms</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathrm{Add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 用自然数递归引入，第二变量为递归变量。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Add}(x,0)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Add}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Add}(x,y)+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Add}(x,0)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Add}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Add}(x,y)+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a_+\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(P_1^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(S,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Add}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_+,\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Add}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a_+\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(P_1^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(S,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Add}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_+,\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Add}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Exercise 2.1.5 要求证明加法本原递归。所给函数项把书中的递归变量放在第一位，再以 (y,x) 求值恢复本节点原来的 (x,y) 函数顺序。归纳检查零与后继方程即可。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-primitive-recursive-terms","status":"resolved","id":"f04544345afa1f92","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb N$；函数项及求值见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Add}:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Add}(x,0)\\coloneqq x,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Add}(x,y+1)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Add}(x,y)+1.","display":true},{"tex":"a_+\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Rec}(P_1^1,\\operatorname{Sub}(S,P_2^3)),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Add}(x,y)=\\operatorname{ev}(a_+,\\langle y,x\\rangle),\n\\qquad \\mathrm{Add}\\in\\mathrm{PR}^{18}_2.","display":true}],"bytes":1309,"backlinks":[{"id":"5a148e8fcfeed406","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\langle n,a\\rangle$ 是下式固定的本原递归配对项 $p_{\\mathrm{pair}}(n,a)$；$p_+$ 是 [[18-df-natural-addition]] 的 $a_+$。数值比较 $s<t$ 由下式定义。$A\\in\\mathsf{Arith}$ 可含有限的数参数与集合参数；$n\\in V_0$、$Z\\in V_1$ 是其指定形式参数，$A(n)$ 仅为该同一公式的显示记号。$X,Y\\in V_1\\setminus(\\mathrm{Occ}(A)\\cup\\{Z\\})$ 且 $X\\ne Y$。所有模板的绑定变量由下式 $\\mathrm{New}^2_j$ 及所列选择函数确定，不能另外自由选择。"},{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-36","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-natural-addition]]"},{"id":"4f01243612f7285e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\mathrm{Add},a_+$ 见 [[18-df-natural-addition]]；求值及函数项见 [[18-df-primitive-recursive-terms]]。"},{"id":"100d7af02276fe1b","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-natural-addition]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-natural-addition]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-natural-addition|18-df-natural-addition]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-natural-addition|18-df-natural-addition]]"}],"outgoing":["f04544345afa1f92"]}